  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Place butter and peanut butter in a microwave-safe mug. Microwave until butter and peanut butter are melted, about 30 seconds. Stir brown sugar, white sugar, and salt into butter mixture. Add egg; stir flour into mixture.",
